{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"03ec6d76d03bfbdc5b52241a4b746fd490e63cffec7942de580b53a5a58e3759","ja":"歌織の素敵な年末年始","zh":"歌织的美好年末年初","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"b98e7c513e98a7d33332fa7ac6382a9c6f4e1ed0afa40f3e3e3e2aad5ba17d0c","ja":"父と話をしてきたわ。\nそれに、友達とも。","zh":"我和父亲谈过了。\n而且，也和朋友谈过了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"9f6e04e5b7db9397c15c2af181948213510a2635a2d8590f1788c76dd612b69f","ja":"え、お友達にも電話したんですか？\nそれで、どうなったんです？","zh":"咦，您还给朋友打电话了吗？\n然后呢，结果怎么样了？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"ea2d14ddd0396c84fc4e62b25c9537a7af1f4634ce844044d06a03170e70864e","ja":"友達の家に遊びには行くけど、お泊りはキャンセル\nしたの。31日中に、帰宅することにするわ。","zh":"虽然会去朋友家玩，但取消了留宿。\n我打算在31号当天就回家。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"39af0c0e180d2ace89a8890726d4d959f418a4ee0748ef96e4c65abda71760a0","ja":"私、朝が弱いから……お泊り会で夜更かし\nしちゃったら、きっと寝正月になっちゃうし。","zh":"我很不擅长早起……要是留宿派对上熬了夜，\n新年肯定就全在睡觉中度过了。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"099ea26da5a14579f82dcc27a990db54f55cd175aef95f6509b4297a04cea8fb","ja":"それくらい全然いいじゃない？\nだって、せっかくのお正月よ。","zh":"那点程度完全没关系吧？\n毕竟这可是难得的新年呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"38d85598e2d031559573a41c2d2985ec6ce1545abbf3feeb697d3c7535c4aa6d","ja":"実はさっき「自分のやりたいことをするのが一番」って\n言われて、考えてみたの。私はどう過ごしたいかって。","zh":"其实刚才有人对我说“做自己想做的事才是最好的”，\n于是我就想了想。自己究竟想怎么度过呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"970ce75864d3ad03d42bf6df7ac913648e84c776920a95af6c43537e7c47ca78","ja":"そうしたら……\nお正月は劇場のみんなに会いたいって思ったんだ！","zh":"然后……\n我就想在新年时和剧场的大家见面了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"5e3d9a40a1619059cc7b68e993460f8a9d67550eaa93ca691f90aaa08efa061c","ja":"歌織さん……ふふっ、嬉しいです♪　あ、でも\nご家族と過ごさなくてもいいんですか？","zh":"歌织小姐……呵呵，我好开心♪ 不过，\n您不用和家人一起过吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"654031dd129745542474e37b4099b7dc505bd8e3b270f6b4fb907f6fcdf937b4","ja":"家族と過ごす時間も、ちゃんととるから大丈夫よ。","zh":"我也一定会好好抽出时间和家人在一起的，所以没关系哦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"e836f2a44e471bf3206758a12d8107523a1c9e19820fbc6422de7e3f287c3286","ja":"ふーん……それじゃあ、私も海外旅行はやめるわ。\nみんなと過ごすお正月も悪くなさそうだしね♪","zh":"哼——……既然这样，我也不去海外旅行了。\n和大家一起过新年好像也不赖嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"a06b7c1b679854237f730b3363867add717a61aaf21f428dd3bfcd28f2380ab0","ja":"うん！　私も、みなさんと年明けに会うのを\n楽しみにしてますね！","zh":"嗯！我也很期待\n在新的一年能和大家见面呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"f2ec920fc0714a3b577b4658e3a514009d6c8cc7039332e4142e175d90a4a0e9","ja":"ええ♪　それじゃあ……。","zh":"嗯♪ 那么……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1133.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"7e80b54cba3f778b6dd8fcd309d9a5c2005fcb7d4838c769fbf9f36898a41850","ja":"今年も大変お世話になりました。\nみなさん、よいお年を♪","zh":"今年承蒙各位关照。\n祝大家过个好年♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:09:21+00:00"}
